During the 2nd War of the Gods, the Snowstorm Dragon and Kelvezu faced each other for the 1st time. It was defeated and fell to the bottom of the sea, where it found a cave of Magic Crystals to be its tomb. In our days, it was revived by the power of the Snow Lady, who rekindled the Ice Flame in its heart. Since the past, the ice dragon kept its anger at Kelvezu burning. And that was its ruin once again.
Thanks to that, we could use Kelvezu to defeat it.

With your help, Zarad and Marina entered the cave and destroyed the glacial river's source at the bottom of the sea.
Now only the Snow Lady is left. Go talk to Sage Celina.

Receive 419,424,529,687 experience points as a reward for your effort.
